### 🔍 Pharmacy Medicine Filtering - Price & Date Examples

# Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy

### 💰 PRICE FILTERING EXAMPLES

### 1. Filter medicines by price range (10-50 currency units)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?priceMin=10&priceMax=50&page=1&limit=10

### 2. Filter medicines with minimum price only (50+ currency units)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?priceMin=50&page=1&limit=10

### 3. Filter medicines with maximum price only (up to 25 currency units)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?priceMax=25&page=1&limit=10

### 4. Filter medicines by exact price (price = 15.99)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?priceMin=15.99&priceMax=15.99&page=1&limit=10

### 5. Low-cost medicines (under 5 currency units)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?priceMax=5&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc&page=1&limit=15

### 6. Premium medicines (100+ currency units)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?priceMin=100&sortBy=price&sortOrder=desc&page=1&limit=10

### 📅 DATE FILTERING EXAMPLES

### 7. Filter medicines created in specific date range (2024)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&createdDateTo=2024-12-31&page=1&limit=10

### 8. Filter medicines added this year (2024)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&page=1&limit=10

### 9. Filter medicines added after specific date
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?createdDateFrom=2024-06-01&page=1&limit=10

### 10. Filter medicines added before specific date
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?createdDateTo=2024-03-31&page=1&limit=10

### 11. Filter medicines added in current month (November 2024)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?createdDateFrom=2024-11-01&createdDateTo=2024-11-30&page=1&limit=10

### 12. Recent medicines added (last 30 days from Nov 19, 2024)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?createdDateFrom=2024-10-20&page=1&limit=10

### 💰📅 COMBINED PRICE & DATE FILTERING EXAMPLES

### 13. Budget medicines (under 20) added this year
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?priceMax=20&createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc&page=1&limit=10

### 14. Mid-range medicines (20-80) added in last 6 months
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?priceMin=20&priceMax=80&createdDateFrom=2024-05-19&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc&page=1&limit=15

### 15. Expensive medicines (100+) added this month
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?priceMin=100&createdDateFrom=2024-11-01&sortBy=price&sortOrder=desc&page=1&limit=10

### 16. Medicines in specific price range added in Q1 2024
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?priceMin=15&priceMax=60&createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&createdDateTo=2024-03-31&page=1&limit=12

### 17. All filters combined: Generic name + Price + Date
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?genericName=omeprazole&priceMin=10&priceMax=50&createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&createdDateTo=2024-12-31&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc&page=1&limit=10

### 18. Complex filter: Name + Price range + Recent date + Stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?name=vitamin&priceMin=5&priceMax=100&createdDateFrom=2024-10-01&stockMin=20&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc&page=1&limit=20

